Sun Nov 22 09:45:33 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.4.3:
  * Fix receiving multiple photos from iOS Photos.
  * Browse now lists AWDL peers like send does, on an owlyd
    lease, showing each receiver once.
  * Transfer fixes: Apple client certificates, link shares,
    DVZip fallback, idle-timeout restart, chunked upload
    with real TotalBytes, 45s Ask timeout, optional
    StatusCode and BLE contact-hash array.
  * test-card: watch Wi-Fi for 1 minute, record per-report
    mode and omdrop implementation; RTL8812BU works in
    exclusive mode, Intel 3168 fails.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sat Oct 31 11:40:00 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.4.2 (still needs boo#1288451)
- Pass LIBEXECDIR to packaging/install.sh, which supports it
  since this release; drop the manual owlyd move.
- Drop Requires: dbus-1: owly talks to the system bus via zbus
  and works with either daemon (dbus-broker has no dbus-1
  provide, so the Require dragged in dbus-daemon everywhere).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Oct 28 13:17:09 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package owly 0.4.1 (boo#1288451)
- Install owlyd in /usr/libexec/owly, not upstream's /usr/lib/owly:
  SELinux labels that lib_t, so systemd would run owlyd as init_t,
  which may not use nl80211, and owlyd would find no Wi-Fi card

